  "description": "Had to redo this since all you trolls thought I could spin the ball against the rubber lined ramp 🤡. But here’s it again with a left to right and a right to left putt. Things like wind, grass growth throughout the day, moisture level, and the imperfections of the green can effect the way the ball rolls!! Obviously not dropping it from exactly the same height but trying to! Just shows you how there are other factors than just your stroke when it comes to putting. (Let’s not turn this post into a debate about climate change like the last one please :) ). #golf #golfing #golfshot #golfcourse #golftips #golftok #golftiktok ",
